    {
      "s": "dong_chinese",
      "t": "Depicts a kneeling person (卩) opening their mouth (口) to offer good wishes. The 礻 component is often used in abstract/spiritual characters."
    },
    {
      "s": "shuowen_jiezi",
      "t": "祭主贊詞者。从示从人口。一曰从兌省。《易》曰：“兌爲口爲巫。”。",
      "w": 1
