    {
      "s": "wiktionary",
      "t": "Ideogram (指事) – a man kneeling with open mouth (兄) next to an altar (示).\nPerhaps related to 觸 (OC *tʰjoɡ, “to butt, knock against”); see there for more (STEDT)."
